# SPA fallback for Cloudflare Pages. Client routes like /pricing and /admin have no
# file on disk, so serve index.html (status 200) and let React Router take over.
# Pages Functions run before static serving, so functions/_middleware.js (the token
# gate) and the /api/* functions are always evaluated first and are never shadowed.
# Existing static assets (the hashed /assets/* files) are served directly and take
# precedence over this rewrite.
/*    /index.html    200
